ocked up in your office  handcuff him to a desk you can't do that  are you worried as a mother Maria Valdez  begged for the early release of her 20  year old son Alex Sanchez locked up in  the Cook County Jail for a nonviolent  offense he spoke to us over the phone  while in jail about the conditions  Sanchez has an upcoming trial while he  waits for the date his attorney was able  to get him released from jail with an  ankle monitor and back home where he's  safe at last check 34 people tested  positive in the Dallas County Jail and  that includes at least 12 jail workers  essential employees people who were  coming to work every day and then going  home to their families now there was a  lawsuit filed against the Dallas County  Sheriff asking for the release of  certain vulnerable inmates Anthony  Oumar thank you
 

